Install SRA Toolkit (Linux / WSL) for sequence retrieval
-----------------------------------------
🔹 Step 1: Download toolkit
wget https://ftp-trace.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sra/sdk/current/sratoolkit.current-ubuntu64.tar.gz
🔹 Step 2: Extract
tar -xvzf sratoolkit.current-ubuntu64.tar.gz
🔹 Step 3: Move to a standard location
mv sratoolkit.* ~/sratoolkit
🔹 Step 4: Add to PATH
echo 'export PATH=$PATH:~/sratoolkit/bin' >> ~/.bashrc
source ~/.bashrc
🔹 Step 5: Test installation
fastq-dump --version
✔ If installed correctly, it will show version.
🔹 Download SRA file
prefetch SRR37746924
🔹 Convert to FASTQ
fastq-dump --split-files SRR37746924
